s","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/day-county"],["ARC or PLC in Day County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/day-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids has January to February under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 41% of normal in January to February and 163% in June to July. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 65% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1976.</p>"}
